?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1199\" data-file-height=\"593\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"thumbcaption\">Proportion of Americans with a bachelor's degree or higher in each U.S. state, the District of Columbia, and Puerto Rico.</div></div><div class=\"tsingle\" style=\"width:199px;max-width:199px\"><div class=\"thumbimage\" style=\"height:97px;overflow:hidden\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Americans_with_an_advanced_degree_by_state.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Americans_with_an_advanced_degree_by_state.svg/250px-Americans_with_an_advanced_degree_by_state.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"197\" height=\"97\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Americans_with_an_advanced_degree_by_state.svg/500px-Americans_with_an_advanced_degree_by_state.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1199\" data-file-height=\"593\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"thumbcaption\">Proportion of Americans with an advanced degree (e.g. Master's, Doctorate) in each U.S. state, the District of Columbia, and Puerto Rico.</div></div><div class=\"tsingle\" style=\"width:186px;max-width:186px\"><div class=\"thumbimage\" style=\"height:97px;overflow:hidden\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:US_bachelor%27s_degree_by_county_in_the_United_States.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/US_bachelor%27s_degree_by_county_in_the_United_States.png/250px-US_bachelor%27s_degree_by_county_in_the_United_States.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"184\" height=\"97\" class=\"mw-file-el