erritories by immigrant population\">immigration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/LGBT_demographics_of_the_United_States\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"LGBT demographics of the United States\">LGBT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_by_non-Hispanic_white_population\" title=\"List of U.S. states by non-Hispanic white population\">non-Hispanic white</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pacific_Islander_Americans#Location\" title=\"Pacific Islander Americans\">Pacific Islander</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spanish_language_in_the_United_States#Historical_demographics\" title=\"Spanish language in the United States\">Spanish-speaking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Educational attainment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_largest_cities_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_population\" title=\"List of largest cities of U.S. states and territories by population\">Largest cities by population</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_median_age\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by median age\">Median age</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_most_popular_given_names_by_state_in_the_United_States\" title=\"List of most popular given names by state in the United States\">Most popular given names</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_the_most_populous_counties_by_U.S._state\" title=\"List of the most populous counties by U.S. state\">Most populous counties</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_net_migration\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by net migration\">Net migration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lists_of_populated_places_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Lists of populated places in the United States\">Populated places</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_cities_by_population_density#States_and_territories\" title=\"List of United States cities by population density\">Population density (cities)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_Race_/_Ethnicity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by Race / Ethnicity\">Race/ethnicity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_religiosity\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by religiosity\">Religiosity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Irreligion_in_the_United_States#Demographics\" title=\"Irreligion in the United States\">irreligion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">Economy</th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_by_per_capita_arts_funding\" title=\"List of U.S. states by per capita arts funding\">Arts funding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_by_the_number_of_billionaires\" title=\"List of U.S. states by the number of billionaires\">Billionaires</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._state_budgets\" title=\"List of U.S. state budgets\">Budgets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_companies_of_the_United_States_by_state\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of companies of the United States by state\">Companies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_by_credit_rating\" title=\"List of U.S. states by credit rating\">Credit ratings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_by_employment_rate\" title=\"List of U.S. states by employment rate\">Employment rates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_exports_and_imports\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by exports and imports\">Exports and imports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Federal_tax_revenue_by_state\" title=\"Federal tax revenue by state\">Federal tax revenue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Federal_taxation_and_spending_by_state\" title=\"Federal taxation and spending by state\">Federal taxation and spending</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_st